-- B11 refuted / unsupported claims (audit verdicts, no computation)
   B11.a REFUTED (attribution): doubling lane's 'every beam configuration
         (width 250-900, ctrl 2-3, span 2-3) fails this profile at the final
         row' and 'first ever / produced NOT by search'.  The DIRECT lane's
         witness file records provenance 'deterministic beam, rank l1deg,
         beam 400, ctrl 2, span 2 + exhaustive 2-row completion' and IS a
         beam product; it verifies (A1-A4).  The universal negative only
         covered the committed solver's ranking family -- itself an instance
         of the THM-3029 beam-negative hazard.  Mathematical content of
         both lanes is unaffected: R = 64 closes either way, twice over.
   B11.b NOT ESTABLISHED: 'the map closes iff input is SLIM'.  Only the
         directions 'slim seeds closed (3 cases)' and 'one fat input failed'
         were observed; no iff is proved.  Downgrade to observation.
   B11.c NOT AUDITED HERE: 'D0(2R) >= 2 D0(R) + O(log R)' (asymptotic claim,
         no finite certificate offered).  Treat as heuristic.
   B11.d CONFIRMED (proof): per-epoch slack D0(R) = o(R) suffices for
         C* <= 1 + gamma*: T(m) = m + 1 + floor(gamma* m) + D0(R(m)) and
         D0(R(m)) <= eps m for all large m, finitely many epochs absorbed
         into the additive constant D; G5-1 assembly is per-epoch.
   B11.e REFUTED AS UNIVERSAL (hostile case = the doubling lane's OWN R=64
         output): 'EVERY floor witness is backbone + corrections' with full-box
         last row and attractor entry FAILS on amm12592_floor_witness_R64_
         boxeph.json -- last block deviates from the full box in 48/76 cells,
         rows R-3/R-2 are not p-q, and the residual NEVER enters the E_m
         attractor (B1/B8).  The witness itself is still VALID (A1-A4).
         The structure DOES hold on all four SLIM witnesses (R=8/16/32 and
         the direct R=64, attractor entry rows 3/8/28/54), so the corrected
         statement is: backbone tail + attractor entry is an observed
         property of SLIM witnesses, not of floor witnesses as such --
         consistent with, and sharpening, the lane's own slim/fat dichotomy.
         Also: 'c_i even' is a tautology of admissibility (B2) and the
         reduced identity is equivalent to the epoch identity (B5); the
         only substantive backbone content is SLIMNESS (B3).

